    <h3>About Mwalimu Link</h3>
    <p>Mwalimu Link (accessible at www.mwalimu.info) is an innovative online platform designed to bridge the gap between teachers seeking employment and schools looking for qualified teaching personnel. As a product of Schools Net Kenya, a registered educational consulting firm, Mwalimu Link is grounded in a deep understanding of Kenya’s education landscape and the pressing need for effective teacher-school matching services.</p>

    <p>The platform serves as a centralized hub where trained teachers can create professional profiles, showcase their qualifications, and search for current teaching opportunities across the country. On the other side, schools and educational institutions can register and post job vacancies, access teacher databases, and identify suitable candidates for their staffing needs. This two-way linkage enhances efficiency in the recruitment process and ensures that quality educators are matched with institutions in need of their services.</p>

    <p>Mwalimu Link addresses a growing challenge in the education sector: the difficulty many schools face in finding skilled teachers promptly, and the struggle many qualified teachers experience in securing timely job placements. By offering an accessible and user-friendly digital space, Mwalimu Link fosters transparency, inclusivity, and professionalism in teacher recruitment.</p>

    <p>As part of Schools Net Kenya’s broader mission to improve access to quality education through consultancy, technology, and research, Mwalimu Link plays a vital role in strengthening the teaching profession. The platform not only empowers educators with employment opportunities but also contributes to improving the overall quality of education by ensuring that schools are adequately staffed.</p>

    <p>Whether you are a teacher searching for your next opportunity or a school in need of dedicated teaching staff, Mwalimu Link is your trusted partner in educational connection and growth.</p>
  </article>
